        "text": "Today, we’re making Praxis-1 available to everyone. Our state-of-the-art world action model turns video pretraining into control for real robots, and it ships with open weights under Apache 2.0, ready to run and fine-tune on your own hardware. https://t.co/jL5ZmpY6x9"
      },
