            "id": "2120533123649941845",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "It also learns new tasks from very little data. With under 30 minutes of teleoperated demos, Praxis-1 succeeded in all 15 simulated trials on Noble Machines’ robot. https://t.co/dhWaL9aG23"
